    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Uniquely designed and tastefully presented this 5/6 bedroomed extended dormer bungalow measuring c.270 sq mtrs offers a superb opportunity to acquire a spacious family home on a large private site in a prime location within walking distance of the City Centre. Boasting many fine architectural features this home has been meticulously maintained with beautifully proportioned rooms filled with natural light offering the intending purchaser endless possibilities. Boasting a private south facing rear garden, this family home is positioned within minutes walk of every conceivable  amenity offering easy access to the City Centre and Phoenix Park and within walking distance of schools, neighbourhood shops, bus links with Phibsboro Luas Station only 400 meters from your front door. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch: with double doors and tiled step \r\n\t\r\nEntrance Hall:\t with decorative tiled floor and recessed spotlights \r\n\r\nLounge:\twith feature bay window and built-in wall unit incorporating shelves and presses\r\n4.4x3.4m \t      \r\n\r\nDining Room:\twith recessed spotlights, overlooking front garden \r\n4.4x3.7m \r\n\t     \r\nStudy/Office: with solid wood floor, built-in wall unit incorporating shelves and presses\r\n3.4x2.4m\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room: L shaped featuring range of wall and floor mounted wooden fitted press units with feature electric range cooker with gas hob, integrated dishwasher, fridge/freezer, tiled behind worktop and tiled floor, double doors to rear garden, entrance to… \t\r\n6.0x5.7m\t     \r\n\r\nFamily Room: with feature open fireplace with built-in brick surround, solid oak wood floor, recessed spotlights, double doors opening to rear garden   \r\n5.5x4.2m\t     \r\n\r\nUtility Room: with built-in shelves and tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and  dryer, door leading to private courtyard \r\n\t\r\nGuest W.C:  with W.C and W.H.B, hot towel rail, fully tiled walls and tiled floor  \r\n\r\nGuest Bedroom Suite:  featuring floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes, solid wood floor and wooden ceiling with recessed lighting \r\n8.1x3.2m\t \r\n\t\r\nEnsuite: with W.C, W.H.B, shower, fully tiled walls and tiled floor \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  suite with marble fireplace, solid oak wood floor and doors to… \r\n4.6x4.3m\r\n\r\nStudy/Bedroom 6:\twith solid oak wood floor \r\n3.4x3.1m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\t\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: with range of floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes and sliderobes,  \r\n6.3x5.1m\r\n\r\nBathroom/Ensuite: with Whirlpool bath with Jacuzzi jets, walk-in shower with multi-jet Jacuzzi, W.C, W.H.B, hot towel rail, fully tiled walls and tiled floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:  with built in wardrobes\r\n3.9x2.9m\r\n\r\nEnsuite: plumbed for W.C, W.H.B and shower \r\n\r\nBedroom 5: with stepped floor currently in use as a games room \r\n5.0x3.6m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\r\nFront garden with a private gravel sweeping driveway bordered by mature plants, shrubs and trees \r\nSouth facing rear garden walled and bordered by trees, shrubs and flowerbeds, laid out in lawn with built-in hot tub\r\nExtensive sandstone patio area with sunny aspect \r\nGarage c.4.4x3.1m built to the side of house with electric up and over door, pitched roof and ESB supply\r\nPrivate paved courtyard\r\nWooden garden shed   \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\nGFCH\r\nFully Alarmed \r\nDouble glazed windows \r\n\r\nLocal Area Information\r\n\r\nPublic transport routes that service New Cabra Road:\r\nBus: 37/38/39/70/122\t\t\t\r\nLuas: Phibsboro Stop\r\n\r\nNearby Areas: Pheonix Park, Navan Road, Stoneybatter, City Centre"
